{"nodeId":"kp:21364","contents":[{"id":"lesson-content:book-4:L169:symmetric-point-substitution","nodeId":"kp:21364","proposedNodeId":"proposal:book-4:curve-symmetry-substitution","kind":"method_application","origin":"editorial_proposal","title":"对称点坐标代入曲线方程判定对称性","scope":"源明确泛化的一般曲线程序及完整椭圆例证。适用于曲线方程，不要求曲线是单值函数；函数奇偶性定义法只为相关分支，不能消除此独立方法缺项。","blocks":[{"role":"question","type":"text","value":"怎样利用曲线方程判断并证明曲线关于坐标轴成轴对称、或关于原点成中心对称？","evidenceIds":["ev:book-4:L169:p4:para29:c8e89f"]},{"role":"step","type":"text","value":"先从图形观察提出对称性，再任取曲线上的一点，写出关于待验证坐标轴或原点的对称点，并检验该点坐标仍满足曲线方程。","evidenceIds":["ev:book-4:L169:p4:para30:e2f9ab"]},{"role":"condition","type":"text","value":"教案例证：椭圆$C:\\frac{x^2}{a^2}+\\frac{y^2}{b^2}=1$，$a>b>0$。任取$M_1(x,y)\\in C$，则其坐标满足方程。","evidenceIds":["ev:book-4:L169:p3:para25:02e436"]},{"role":"step","type":"text","value":"关于$y$轴的对称点为$M_2(-x,y)$，且$\\frac{(-x)^2}{a^2}+\\frac{y^2}{b^2}=1$，故$M_2\\in C$，曲线关于$y$轴对称。","evidenceIds":["ev:book-4:L169:p3:para25:ac877c"]},{"role":"step","type":"text","value":"同理，关于$x$轴的$M_3(x,-y)$、关于原点的$M_4(-x,-y)$也满足$\\frac{x^2}{a^2}+\\frac{y^2}{b^2}=1$，都在$C$上，故椭圆关于$x$轴和原点对称。","evidenceIds":["ev:book-4:L169:p4:para26:1343db"]}],"contentOrigin":"source_based_reconstruction","wordingStatus":"source_based_reconstruction","matching":{"status":"confirmed","reason":"完整条件及步骤按原页整理；引文保留原生短句，整理正文不是教材逐字定义。"},"evidence":[{"id":"ev:book-4:L169:p4:para29:c8e89f","sourceId":"L169","sourceSha256":"a45edd0c002bc714c1266208a98a7271de13b43f7899b63a990559b148509d6e","locator":{"headingPath":["椭圆（2）","有源补充"],"part":"word/document.xml","paragraphIndex":29,"tableIndex":null,"rowIndex":null,"cellIndex":null,"renderedPage":4,"printedPage":null,"equationObjectId":null,"renderVariant":"sample-point-difference-original-render"},"quote":"如何利用曲线方程判断和证明","wordingChecked":true,"mathChecked":true,"mathSourceAsset":null,"rawMetadataRetainedInOriginalJson":true,"resource":{"url":null,"sourceId":"L169","requestedPath":"increments/u13-u15-l169-v1/evidence/L169/page-0